@startuml
' Injury System - Project Idea

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Patient
actor Doctor
actor Admin

rectangle "Injury System (PHP + SQLite/JSON)" as System {
  usecase "Register" as UC_Register
  usecase "Login" as UC_Login
  usecase "Submit Injury Form" as UC_Injury
  usecase "View Appointments" as UC_ViewAppt
  usecase "View Reports" as UC_ViewReport
  usecase "Confirm Appointment" as UC_ConfirmAppt
  usecase "Cancel Appointment" as UC_CancelAppt
  usecase "Create Report" as UC_CreateReport
}

database "SQLite/JSON" as DB

Patient --> UC_Register
Patient --> UC_Login
Patient --> UC_Injury
Patient --> UC_ViewAppt
Patient --> UC_ViewReport

Doctor --> UC_Login
Doctor --> UC_ViewAppt
Doctor --> UC_ConfirmAppt
Doctor --> UC_CancelAppt
Doctor --> UC_CreateReport

Admin --> UC_ViewReport

UC_Register --> DB
UC_Login --> DB
UC_Injury --> DB
UC_ViewAppt --> DB
UC_ConfirmAppt --> DB
UC_CancelAppt --> DB
UC_CreateReport --> DB
UC_ViewReport --> DB

note right of System
Plain HTML/CSS/PHP
Sessions for auth
No encryption (placeholder)
end note

@enduml
